<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Proxy">Proxy <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20IconProxy.png"><img alt="IconProxy.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/5/54/IconProxy.png" width="16" height="16" /></a></span></h2>
<p>A proxy is simply a model, with no special properties or abilities beyond its visual appearance. They were intended as placeholders during game development, to eventually be replaced with full-blown placeables and such, but there's no fundamental reason why they can't be used as-is.
</p>
<table cellspacing="0px" cellpadding="2px" style="background-color:transparent;">
